#: conf.json:summary
msgid "Starter repository with the build, test, CI and documentation setup shared by every Luna-Flow MoonBit library."
msgstr "一个起步仓库，提供每个 Luna-Flow MoonBit 库共用的构建、测试、CI 与文档配置。"

#: manual/api/core.md:1
msgid "core API"
msgstr "core API"

#: manual/api/core.md:5
msgid "The root package of `Luna-Flow/luna-template`, imported as `@luna-template`, exports one function. Its public surface, as recorded in `src/pkg.generated.mbti`, is:"
msgstr "`Luna-Flow/luna-template` 的根包以 `@luna-template` 导入，只导出一个函数。它的公开接口记录在 `src/pkg.generated.mbti` 中，内容如下："

#: manual/api/core.md:15
msgid "Greeting"
msgstr "问候语"

#: manual/api/core.md:21
msgid "Returns the fixed greeting `hello from Luna-Flow`."
msgstr "返回固定的问候语 `hello from Luna-Flow`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:27
msgid "`hello` takes no arguments and returns the same 20-character string on every call. It has no preconditions, never raises and never aborts, and it runs in constant time. Because it has no inputs and no effects, it satisfies the law"
msgstr "`hello` 不接受参数，每次调用都返回同一个长度为 20 的字符串。它没有前置条件，从不抛出错误也从不中止，运行时间为常数。由于它既没有输入也没有副作用，它满足定律"

#: manual/api/core.md:35
msgid "on every backend, so any call can be replaced by the literal. The [design note](../design/core.md) explains why a constant function was chosen and why a single test checks it completely."
msgstr "并且在每个后端上都成立，因此任何一次调用都可以替换为该字面量。[设计说明](../design/core.md)解释了为什么选择常函数，以及为什么一个测试就能完整地检查它。"

#: manual/design/core.md:1
msgid "core design"
msgstr "core 设计"

#: manual/design/core.md:5
msgid "Design goal"
msgstr "设计目标"

#: manual/design/core.md:7
msgid "The root package exists so that a repository created from the template is complete on its first commit. Continuous integration needs code to build on every backend, `moon info` needs a public item to record in the interface file, the test suite needs a behaviour to check, and each chapter of the manual needs an item to describe. `hello` is the smallest item that serves all four, and its behaviour can be stated exactly in one equation."
msgstr "根包的存在，是为了让从模板创建的仓库在第一次提交时就是完整的。持续集成需要能在每个后端上构建的代码，`moon info` 需要一个可以记录到接口文件中的公开条目，测试套件需要一个可检查的行为，手册的每一章都需要一个可描述的条目。`hello` 是能同时满足这四点的最小条目，而且它的行为可以用一个等式精确表述。"

#: manual/design/core.md:14
msgid "Mathematical background"
msgstr "数学背景"

#: manual/design/core.md:18
msgid "Read a MoonBit type as the set of its values. The type `Unit` has exactly one value, so it is the one-point set $\\mathbf{1} = \\{\\star\\}$, and a function that takes no arguments and has no effects is a function $f : \\mathbf{1} \\to S$. Such a function is determined by its single value."
msgstr "把 MoonBit 类型看作其值的集合。类型 `Unit` 恰好有一个值，所以它是单点集 $\\mathbf{1} = \\{\\star\\}$；一个不接受参数、没有副作用的函数就是一个函数 $f : \\mathbf{1} \\to S$。这样的函数由它唯一的取值决定。"

#: manual/design/core.md:29
msgid "The two maps are inverse to each other. For every $s \\in S$ and every $f : \\mathbf{1} \\to S$:"
msgstr "这两个映射互为逆映射。对每个 $s \\in S$ 和每个 $f : \\mathbf{1} \\to S$："

#: manual/design/core.md:41
msgid "So $\\operatorname{Hom}(\\mathbf{1}, S) \\cong S$: specifying a pure function without arguments is the same as specifying one value.[^unit] The attachment writes the argument out in full."
msgstr "因此 $\\operatorname{Hom}(\\mathbf{1}, S) \\cong S$：给出一个无参数的纯函数，等同于给出一个值。[^unit] 附件完整写出了这一论证。"

#: manual/design/core.md:45
msgid "In category theory this says that the one-point set is a generator of the category of sets: a set is recovered from the maps out of $\\mathbf{1}$."
msgstr "用范畴论的语言说，单点集是集合范畴的生成元：一个集合可以由从 $\\mathbf{1}$ 出发的映射还原出来。"

#: manual/design/core.md:48
msgid "[Constant functions and the unit type](../../attachments/design_core_constant-functions.typ)"
msgstr "[常函数与单位类型](../../attachments/design_core_constant-functions.typ)"

#: manual/design/core.md:50
msgid "Design decisions"
msgstr "设计决策"

#: manual/design/core.md:52
msgid "A constant function as the only item"
msgstr "以一个常函数作为唯一条目"

#: manual/design/core.md:54
msgid "The problem is to give a new repository one public item whose behaviour can be documented and tested completely, on every backend, without tying the template to a mathematical domain. Three shapes were considered: a constant function `hello() -> String`, a function of an argument such as `greet(name) -> String`, and a constant value `pub let greeting : String`."
msgstr "要解决的问题是：为新仓库提供一个公开条目，它的行为可以在每个后端上被完整地文档化和测试，同时又不把模板绑定到某个数学领域。我们考虑了三种形式：常函数 `hello() -> String`、带参数的函数（如 `greet(name) -> String`），以及常量值 `pub let greeting : String`。"

#: manual/design/core.md:60
msgid "The constant function was chosen. By the background above, its whole specification is the single equation $\\texttt{hello}() = \\texttt{\"hello from Luna-Flow\"}$, so the API page can state it exactly and the tests can check it exactly. A function of an argument has one equation per input string, infinitely many, so any test only samples it. A constant value is just as simple, but it would model a `pub let` item rather than the function signatures that real packages mostly export."
msgstr "最终选择了常函数。根据上面的背景，它的全部规格就是一个等式 $\\texttt{hello}() = \\texttt{\"hello from Luna-Flow\"}$，因此 API 页面可以精确地陈述它，测试也可以精确地检查它。带参数的函数对每个输入字符串都有一个等式，共有无穷多个，因此任何测试都只能抽样。常量值同样简单，但它示范的是 `pub let` 条目，而真实的包大多导出的是函数签名。"

#: manual/design/core.md:68
msgid "One snapshot test is exhaustive"
msgstr "一个快照测试即是穷尽测试"

#: manual/design/core.md:70
msgid "A test suite proves correctness only when it covers every input. For `hello` the input set is $\\mathbf{1}$, so the count of cases is"
msgstr "只有覆盖了所有输入，测试套件才能证明正确性。对 `hello` 来说，输入集合是 $\\mathbf{1}$，所以用例的个数是"

#: manual/design/core.md:77
msgid "and a single passing `inspect(@luna-template.hello(), content=c)` shows $\\texttt{hello} = \\Psi(c)$, that is, the function equals its specification. The package therefore has one test and no property tests; adding more would check nothing new."
msgstr "因此只要一个 `inspect(@luna-template.hello(), content=c)` 通过，就说明 $\\texttt{hello} = \\Psi(c)$，也就是函数等于它的规格。所以这个包只有一个测试，没有性质测试；再增加测试也检查不到任何新内容。"

#: manual/design/core.md:82
msgid "The root package is documented as `core`"
msgstr "根包以 `core` 为名编写文档"

#: manual/design/core.md:84
msgid "The standard names a page after the package path under the source root. The root package has the empty path, so the template uses the name `core`, as `luna-generic` does. A repository that adds `src/<path>` documents it as `<path>.md` in each chapter."
msgstr "文档标准以包在源码根目录下的路径为页面命名。根包的路径为空，所以模板使用 `core` 这个名字，与 `luna-generic` 相同。若仓库新增了 `src/<path>`，则在每一章中以 `<path>.md` 为其编写文档。"

#: manual/design/core.md:89
msgid "Correctness / invariants"
msgstr "正确性 / 不变量"

#: manual/design/core.md:91
msgid "**Determinism.** `hello` reads no state and performs no effects, so $\\texttt{hello}() = \\texttt{hello}()$ for any two calls, on any backend."
msgstr "**确定性。** `hello` 不读取任何状态，也不产生副作用，因此在任何后端上，任意两次调用都满足 $\\texttt{hello}() = \\texttt{hello}()$。"

#: manual/design/core.md:93
msgid "**Length.** The result has $5 + 1 + 4 + 1 + 9 = 20$ UTF-16 code units, for `hello`, the two spaces, `from` and `Luna-Flow`. The test asserts this."
msgstr "**长度。** 结果有 $5 + 1 + 4 + 1 + 9 = 20$ 个 UTF-16 码元，分别来自 `hello`、两个空格、`from` 和 `Luna-Flow`。测试会断言这一点。"

#: manual/design/core.md:95
msgid "**Portability.** The package has no target-specific files, so `wasm-gc`, `wasm`, `js` and `native` build the same code; `just check-all` and `just test-all` check all four."
msgstr "**可移植性。** 这个包没有针对特定目标的文件，因此 `wasm-gc`、`wasm`、`js` 和 `native` 构建的是同一份代码；`just check-all` 和 `just test-all` 会检查全部四个目标。"

#: manual/design/core.md:98
msgid "**Cost.** A call returns a string literal and takes constant time."
msgstr "**开销。** 一次调用返回一个字符串字面量，耗时为常数。"

#: manual/design/core.md:100
msgid "Alternatives rejected"
msgstr "被否决的方案"

#: manual/design/core.md:102
msgid "**An empty package.** It leaves the interface file, the tests and the API page with nothing to check, so mistakes in the setup go unnoticed until the first real item arrives."
msgstr "**空包。** 它让接口文件、测试和 API 页面都无物可查，配置中的错误会一直被忽略，直到第一个真正的条目出现。"

#: manual/design/core.md:105
msgid "**A small numeric example.** It would tie the template to one domain and to the Luna-Flow packages that domain needs, and every new repository would have to remove those dependencies first."
msgstr "**一个小型数值示例。** 它会把模板绑定到某个领域以及该领域所需的 Luna-Flow 包，每个新仓库都得先删除这些依赖。"

#: manual/design/core.md:108
msgid "**A greeting with an argument.** As derived above, it cannot be tested exhaustively, which would make the model test suite misleading."
msgstr "**带参数的问候函数。** 如上文推导，它无法被穷尽测试，会让作为示范的测试套件产生误导。"

#: manual/design/core.md:111
msgid "Boundaries"
msgstr "边界"

#: manual/design/core.md:113
msgid "The package does not read input, print, or depend on any other package. It does not localise the greeting: the manual is translated, but `hello` always returns the English text. It is not meant to be depended on; a repository created from the template replaces it with its own packages."
msgstr "这个包不读取输入、不打印输出，也不依赖任何其他包。它不对问候语做本地化：手册有翻译，但 `hello` 始终返回英文文本。它也不是供人依赖的包；从模板创建的仓库会用自己的包替换它。"

#: manual/index.md:1
msgid "template"
msgstr "template"

#: manual/index.md:5
msgid "The `template` repository, with the MoonBit module `Luna-Flow/luna-template`, is the starter repository that every new Luna-Flow MoonBit library is created from. It contains the build, test, CI and documentation setup that the organisation expects, and one small root package with a single function, `hello`, so that each of those pieces has something real to check from the first commit. This manual documents that package, and it is written to serve as a model of the [documentation standard](https://lunaflow.cn/en/contribute/documentation_standard/): when you start a new repository, keep the structure of these pages and replace their content."
msgstr "`template` 仓库（MoonBit 模块为 `Luna-Flow/luna-template`）是每个新的 Luna-Flow MoonBit 库的起步仓库。它包含组织所要求的构建、测试、CI 与文档配置，以及一个只有单个函数 `hello` 的小型根包，使这些部分从第一次提交起就有真实的内容可以检查。本手册为这个包编写文档，同时也作为[文档标准](https://lunaflow.cn/en/contribute/documentation_standard/)的范例：创建新仓库时，请保留这些页面的结构，替换其中的内容。"

