msgstr "[API](api/core.md) · [教程](tutorial/core.md) · [设计](design/core.md)"

#: manual/index.md:23
msgid "The package at the source root (`src/`) is documented under the name `core`. A package at `src/<path>` would be documented as `api/<path>.md`, `tutorial/<path>.md` and `design/<path>.md`."
msgstr "位于源码根目录（`src/`）的包以 `core` 为名编写文档。位于 `src/<path>` 的包则以 `api/<path>.md`、`tutorial/<path>.md` 和 `design/<path>.md` 编写文档。"

#: manual/index.md:27
msgid "Reading paths"
msgstr "阅读路径"

#: manual/index.md:29
msgid "If you are new to the package, start with the [tutorial](tutorial/core.md): it installs the module, calls `hello` and pins its value in a test. If you already use it, the [API reference](api/core.md) lists every public name with its exact signature and semantics. If you want to change the package, or create a new repository from this template, read the [design note](design/core.md) for the reasoning behind it and [CONTRIBUTING.md](../../CONTRIBUTING.md) for the workflow."
msgstr "如果你初次接触这个包，请从[教程](tutorial/core.md)开始：它会安装模块、调用 `hello`，并在测试中固定其取值。如果你已经在使用它，[API 参考](api/core.md)列出了每个公开名称及其精确签名和语义。如果你想修改这个包，或从这个模板创建新仓库，请阅读[设计说明](design/core.md)了解背后的理由，并阅读 [CONTRIBUTING.md](../../CONTRIBUTING.md) 了解工作流程。"

#: manual/index.md:37
msgid "Toolchain"
msgstr "工具链"

#: manual/index.md:39
msgid "The module uses the `moon.mod` and `moon.pkg` manifest syntax and needs MoonBit `moonc` 0.10 or later. Local workflows run through `just`; the manual is checked with `lunadoc`, which needs Node.js, and Typst attachments need `typst`."
msgstr "本模块使用 `moon.mod` 与 `moon.pkg` 清单语法，需要 MoonBit `moonc` 0.10 或更高版本。本地工作流通过 `just` 运行；手册由 `lunadoc` 检查，它需要 Node.js，Typst 附件则需要 `typst`。"

